Key changes summary:

**`logs.js` store:**
- Added `discardPatterns`, `tailSize`, `follow`, `showAIView` to state
- Moved the full filtering + highlighting logic into `filteredLogs` getter (previously it was only in the component)
- Added mutations: `setDiscardPatterns`, `setTailSize`, `setFollow`, `setShowAIView`
- `fetchLogs` now falls back to `state.tailSize` if no argument passed

**`LogViewer.vue`:**
- Removed local state that's now in the store: `discardPatterns`, `tailSize`, `follow`, `showAIView`, `filter`
- All inputs now bind to store via `:value` + `@input`/`@change` instead of `v-model`
- `filteredLogs` computed removed — now uses `$storex.logs.filteredLogs` directly
- `rawLogs` computed removed — uses `$storex.logs.rawLogs` directly in template
